# --- end of jump course iw ---

quest title=The Engine Decks
quest intro=A mast out of the sea, a stern on the seabed. Climb to the mast's platform.
step reach|stern_mast|1|Climb the stern mast sticking out of the sea
step blueprint|Blueprint_WindTurbine|1|Take the wind turbine's plans from the mast box
step reach|boiler_hall|1|Dive into the stern and find the air in the boiler hall
step read|Captain's log, day 40|1|Read the captain's log
step kill|Angler fish|3|Deal with the three anglers in the engine room
step blueprint|Blueprint_BatteryAdvanced|1|Take the advanced battery's plans from the engine store
step blueprint|Blueprint_HeadLight_Advanced|1|Take the advanced headlight's plans from the chief engineer's locker
step reach|shaft|1|Swim on into the shaft tunnel's air
step open|Captain's room|1|Open the captain's room with the chief's keycard
step read|Hedda Brask's account|1|Read Hedda Brask's account
step read|The radio officer|1|Find the radio officer at her switch, next door in the officers' galley
step read|Radio cable, chopped|1|Look at the chopped radio cable beside her
step blueprint|Blueprint_ElectricGrill|1|Take the electric grill's plans from the officers' galley
step collect|story:fuse|3|Find the three breaker fuses (engine store, chief's locker, shaft box)
step collect|story:breaker|1|Throw the main breaker in the engine room
step reach|prop_trench|1|With the lights on, dive into the dark trench beside the stern to the Whale's propeller
step reach|funnel_top|1|Climb the fallen funnel, the ladder tower out of the sea, to leave the stern
quest done=The Whale's lights burn again. Hedda says: Saga Drift, 900 - the flotilla city went quiet first.
quest reward=MetalIngot*3;CopperIngot*2;Battery*1

prop captvault obj.name=captvault
prop deckslights obj.name=deckslights
